### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/health

### Setup (loads the examples from ./examples)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8787/setup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "room_plan_path": "examples/room_plan.example.json",
  "agents_path": "examples/agents.example.json",
  "memory_mode": "shared_history"
}

### Chat
POST http://127.0.0.1:8787/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "{{session_id}}",
  "active_agent_id": "agent_tech",
  "user_text": "What does your product cost, and do you offer volume discounts?"
}

### Speech-to-Text (place sample.wav in the examples directory)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8787/stt
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=VoiceBoundary

--VoiceBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="model"

whisper-1
--VoiceBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="language"

en
--VoiceBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="audio"; filename="sample.wav"
Content-Type: audio/wav

< ./sample.wav
--VoiceBoundary--
